Vinalax website backend (Express + MongoDB)

- Website enquiries and website admin login (MongoDB).
- /api/client/* : client portal. Companies and employees sign in with the login
  the HR software admin created for them (HR software -> Employee Access). This service
  only forwards those requests to the HR software API (HR_API_BASE_URL).

Local run:
  cp .env.example .env    # fill in values
  npm ci
  npm start               # http://localhost:5002/api/health

Production (AWS EC2, same server as the HR software): see DEPLOY-AWS.md
